          "id": "india-mf-inflows-october-2026-11-11",
          "headline": "Mutual funds draw Rs 1.74 lakh crore in October as debt money returns",
          "summary": "AMFI data show the fund industry took in a net Rs 1.74 lakh crore in October, after a Rs 1.33 lakh crore outflow in September. Debt funds drew over Rs 1.13 lakh crore. Equity fund inflows fell about 14% to Rs 32,994 crore, and SIP contributions dipped 1% to Rs 32,162 crore from September's record.",
