          "headline": "Iran's Ghalibaf says 'the ball is in the US court' and Hormuz won't return to old rules",
          "summary": "Iran's parliament speaker and chief negotiator Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf told Al Jazeera that Tehran has sent its seven conditions to Washington through Qatar and is waiting for a reply. He said the Strait of Hormuz will never return to its pre-war status and that lack of trust in the US blocks a deal. Iran has rejected a US idea to move its enriched uranium abroad and warns it will widen the war if attacked.",
